OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for non-fatal          
OL,4,Astrangulation and domestic abuse       
OL,6,FA 41-year-old man has been jailed for  
OL,7,F16-and-a-half months for threatening to
OL,8,Fburn his ex-partners house down with   
OL,9,Fher inside and for strangling her with 
OL,10,Fa car seatbelt.                        
OL,12,FGary Oscroft of Clifton House in North 
OL,13,FQueen Street has 147 previous          
OL,14,Fconvictions on his record.             
OL,16,FOscroft previously pleaded guilty to   
OL,17,Fcharges of domestic abuse and non-fatal
OL,18,Fstrangulation or asphyxiation.         
