OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for non-fatal          
OL,4,Astrangulation and domestic abuse       
OL,6,FBelfast Crown Court heard the victim   
OL,7,Ftold police that Oscroft had said, "You
OL,8,Fbetter be getting the kids minded      
OL,9,Ftonight because I am going to burn your
OL,10,Fhouse down with you in it".            
